WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.670
Here's Director's Lookbook in under a minute.

00:02.720 --> 00:04.430
First, pick what you're making.

00:04.480 --> 00:06.990
Photo, video, website or game.

00:07.040 --> 00:08.750
Then say the feeling.

00:08.800 --> 00:10.750
Rainy cafe at night.

00:10.800 --> 00:11.710
Get the look.

00:11.760 --> 00:16.590
A camera, a light, a film stock and a palette, each with the name directors use.

00:16.640 --> 00:17.950
Not sure about one card?

00:18.000 --> 00:18.910
Tap New.

00:18.960 --> 00:20.190
Liked the last one better?

00:20.240 --> 00:21.150
Tap back.

00:21.200 --> 00:24.430
Copy the prompt, and paste it into your image or video tool.

00:24.480 --> 00:25.390
Just browsing?

00:25.440 --> 00:26.510
Open a cheat sheet.

00:26.560 --> 00:31.310
Camera shots, lighting, poses, fonts, music, each with a picture.

00:31.360 --> 00:33.550
Tap the ones you like, and add them to your look.

00:33.600 --> 00:35.070
Or scroll the library.

00:35.120 --> 00:36.990
Every card shows an example.

00:37.040 --> 00:38.350
Director's Lookbook.

00:38.400 --> 00:39.470
Say the feeling.

00:39.520 --> 00:41.030
Get the look.
